{"id":"f092de33576c5a12","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-comp-halting-computation.md","title":"ZFC Comp Halting Computation","display":"df-zfc-comp-halting-computation — ZFC Comp Halting Computation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comp-halting-computation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comp-halting-computation"],"display":"df-zfc-comp-halting-computation — ZFC Comp Halting Computation","depends_on":["[[58-df-turing-machine]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comp-halting-computation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comp-halting-computation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comp-halting-computation — ZFC Comp Halting Computation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"af73296236e5df83\" href=\"?note=af73296236e5df83\" title=\"58-df-turing-machine\">58-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,x,Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\in V\">\\(M,x,Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"af73296236e5df83\" href=\"?note=af73296236e5df83\" title=\"58-df-turing-machine.md\">58-df-turing-machine.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCompHaltingComputation}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCompHaltingComputation}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comp\\text{-}halting\\text{-}computation} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCompHaltingComputation}_S(M,x)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TM}_S(M)\\land\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\nM=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\rangle\\land x\\in\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists r\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(r,n+1,\\operatorname{ran}(r))\\land\n\\exists t_0\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(t_0,\\mathbb Z,\\Gamma)\\land\n\\forall i\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(t_0(i)=\\begin{cases}x(i)&amp;0\\leq i&lt;|x|\\\\0&amp;i&lt;0\\lor |x|\\leq i\\end{cases})\\land\nr(0)=\\langle q_0,t_0,0\\rangle\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall k\\in n\\;\\exists q_k,t_k,h_k,q_{k+1},a_k,d_k\\;\\Bigl(\nr(k)=\\langle q_k,t_k,h_k\\rangle\\land h_k\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\\mathrm{Function}(t_k,\\mathbb Z,\\Gamma)\\land\n\\delta(\\langle q_k,t_k(h_k)\\rangle)=\\langle q_{k+1},a_k,d_k\\rangle\\land\nr(k+1)=\\langle q_{k+1},t_k[h_k\\mapsto a_k],h_k+d_k\\rangle\\Bigr)\\land\n\\exists q,t,h\\;\\bigl(r(n)=\\langle q,t,h\\rangle\\land q\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comp\\text{-}halting\\text{-}computation} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCompHaltingComputation}_S(M,x)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TM}_S(M)\\land\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\nM=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\rangle\\land x\\in\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists r\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(r,n+1,\\operatorname{ran}(r))\\land\n\\exists t_0\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(t_0,\\mathbb Z,\\Gamma)\\land\n\\forall i\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(t_0(i)=\\begin{cases}x(i)&amp;0\\leq i&lt;|x|\\\\0&amp;i&lt;0\\lor |x|\\leq i\\end{cases})\\land\nr(0)=\\langle q_0,t_0,0\\rangle\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall k\\in n\\;\\exists q_k,t_k,h_k,q_{k+1},a_k,d_k\\;\\Bigl(\nr(k)=\\langle q_k,t_k,h_k\\rangle\\land h_k\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\\mathrm{Function}(t_k,\\mathbb Z,\\Gamma)\\land\n\\delta(\\langle q_k,t_k(h_k)\\rangle)=\\langle q_{k+1},a_k,d_k\\rangle\\land\nr(k+1)=\\langle q_{k+1},t_k[h_k\\mapsto a_k],h_k+d_k\\rangle\\Bigr)\\land\n\\exists q,t,h\\;\\bigl(r(n)=\\langle q,t,h\\rangle\\land q\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The witness is a finite, correctly initialized transition sequence whose tape update, head move, and final halting state are read directly from the machine tuple; no undeclared configuration or step selector remains.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"af73296236e5df83","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","